## 5. What to extend only with an approved contract

| Capability | Required additional integration |
| :--- | :--- |
| Order-specific links/actions | Allowed payload/schema, route identifiers, authentication/authorization, and account-scoped pending-intent design. |
| Topic subscriptions/preferences | Approved audience policy and backend endpoint/subscription lifecycle. Do not expose arbitrary topic joins from the UI. |
| Rich media or actionable categories | Platform extension/action configuration and actual library APIs; not enabled by naming a class NotificationService. |
| Silent background synchronization | Appropriate provider payload/capabilities and bounded durable-work integration; delivery is not guaranteed. |
| Opt-out/token deletion | Server disassociation, current-account ownership, in-flight work handling, and selected SDK lifecycle; token deletion alone is not a global user opt-out. |

