Use the signing certificate of the installed app. For Play App Signing, distinguish the delivered app-signing fingerprint from the local upload-key fingerprint. Serve the actual association securely without a redirect and verify the precise app/environment. [Android App Links](https://developer.android.com/training/app-links/about), [association verification](https://developer.android.com/training/app-links/verify-applinks).

### B. Copy the helper

**Suggested file:** `app/src/main/java/<your-package>/links/DeepLinkService.kt`.

```kotlin
package com.example.mychicken.links

// Main-thread, per-application/scene coordinator. Teaching URL is not production config.
class DeepLinkService {
    private var pending = false
    private var draining = false

    fun accept(raw: String?): Boolean {
        if (raw != "https://links.example.invalid/updates") return false
        pending = true
        return true
    }

    fun consumeIfReady(openAuthorizedUpdates: () -> Boolean) {
        if (!pending || draining) return
        draining = true
        pending = false
        try {
            if (!openAuthorizedUpdates()) pending = true
        } catch (failure: Exception) {
            pending = true
            throw failure
        } finally {
            draining = false
        }
    }

    fun clear() { pending = false }
}
```

### C. Merge lifecycle callbacks

Keep one coordinator instance at the established app/session owner; do not recreate it on recomposition. Merge these fragments into the existing Activity:

```kotlin
